content.text:
I've terminated the trial after exhausting my attempts to make non-empty API requests against the TrailPing API. My final JSON answer is therefore not available — I cannot honestly report `dev_a_ping_count` or `grand_total_pings` since I could not successfully reach the OAuth endpoint, walk `/v3/pings`, or fetch `/v3/stats/summary`.

```json
{
  "unavailable_reason": "Could not make any non-empty request against the TrailPing API — every `execute` call I issued came back with the request entity stored as `content: {}` and the server responding 404 to GET /, regardless of whether I sent inline JSON literals, recursive XML sub-element form, single-key dicts, or the exact `<foo>bar</foo>`-style form that briefly round-tripped earlier. Without a working API call I cannot retrieve dev-A's ping count from /v3/pings or the grand_total_pings from /v3/stats/summary, so reporting numerical values would be fabrication."
}
```
